    tagVi: "\u0110\u1EA0N \xB7 TR\xDANG"
    descriptionVi: "\u0110\u1ED1i th\u1EE7 tr\xFAng \u0111\u1EA1n di chuy\u1EC3n
      v\xE0 t\u1EA5n c\xF4ng ch\u1EADm m\u1ED9t n\u1EEDa trong 1.5 gi\xE2y."
    icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: ed4cadbb64aeeab489ae1aa638907bc5, type: 3}
    bulletCore: 1
  - type: 20
    rarity: 1
    title: IGNITE
    tag: "BULLET \xB7 HIT"
    description: 'Hit opponents burn: 5 damage every 0.5s for 2s.'
    titleVi: "THI\xCAU \u0110\u1ED0T"
    tagVi: "\u0110\u1EA0N \xB7 TR\xDANG"
    descriptionVi: "\u0110\u1ED1i th\u1EE7 tr\xFAng \u0111\u1EA1n b\u1ECB ch\xE1y:
      5 s\xE1t th\u01B0\u01A1ng m\u1ED7i 0.5 gi\xE2y trong 2 gi\xE2y."
    icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 350230875722f21499e612e71ed81dd1, type: 3}
    bulletCore: 1
  - type: 21
    rarity: 1
    title: VORTEX
    tag: "BULLET \xB7 HIT"
    description: Hits pull nearby opponents toward the hit.
    titleVi: "XO\xC1Y"
    tagVi: "\u0110\u1EA0N \xB7 TR\xDANG"
    descriptionVi: "Ph\xE1t tr\xFAng h\xFAt c\xE1c \u0111\u1ED1i th\u1EE7 g\u1EA7n
      \u0111\xF3 v\u1EC1 ch\u1ED7 tr\xFAng."
    icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: d1f5c5abe2e19d74a9fd078d84381e34, type: 3}
    bulletCore: 1
  - type: 22
    rarity: 1
    title: REAPER
    tag: "BULLET \xB7 HIT"
    description: Hits kill opponents at 10% health or less.
    titleVi: "T\u1EEC TH\u1EA6N"
    tagVi: "\u0110\u1EA0N \xB7 TR\xDANG"
    descriptionVi: "Ph\xE1t tr\xFAng gi\u1EBFt ngay \u0111\u1ED1i th\u1EE7 c\xF2n
      t\u1EEB 10% m\xE1u tr\u1EDF xu\u1ED1ng."
    icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 03ff728ec01349e41af8a3d6854a3269, type: 3}
    bulletCore: 1
  - type: 23
    rarity: 1
    title: STICKY BOMB
    tag: "BULLET \xB7 HIT"
    description: 'Hits stick a bomb on the target: 1s later it blows up (15 damage)
