    titleVi: "BOM D\xCDNH"
    tagVi: "\u0110\u1EA0N \xB7 TR\xDANG"
    descriptionVi: "Tr\xFAng \u0111\xEDch g\u1EAFn bom l\xEAn ng\u01B0\u1EDDi: 1
      gi\xE2y sau n\u1ED5 (15 s\xE1t th\u01B0\u01A1ng) v\xE0 h\u1EA5t v\u0103ng m\u1ECDi
      ng\u01B0\u1EDDi."
    icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 0264b4e3dc76ce94a976a8918bae1ba4, type: 3}
    bulletCore: 1
  - type: 24
    rarity: 2
    title: THUNDER
    tag: "BULLET \xB7 HIT"
    description: 'Every hit calls lightning down from the sky onto the target: +60%
      damage.'
    titleVi: "S\u1EA4M S\xC9T"
    tagVi: "\u0110\u1EA0N \xB7 TR\xDANG"
    descriptionVi: "M\u1ED7i ph\xE1t tr\xFAng g\u1ECDi s\xE9t t\u1EEB tr\u1EDDi \u0111\xE1nh
      xu\u1ED1ng m\u1EE5c ti\xEAu: +60% s\xE1t th\u01B0\u01A1ng."
    icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: cbed29f584d7c2c43a6a23dceb07dd32, type: 3}
    bulletCore: 1
  - type: 25
    rarity: 1
    title: SHRAPNEL
    tag: "BULLET \xB7 END"
    description: Bullets burst into 3 shards when they stop (30% damage each).
    titleVi: "M\u1EA2NH V\u1EE0"
    tagVi: "\u0110\u1EA0N \xB7 K\u1EBET TH\xDAC"
    descriptionVi: "\u0110\u1EA1n v\u1EE1 th\xE0nh 3 m\u1EA3nh khi d\u1EEBng l\u1EA1i
